Subject: [PATCH] feat: KIVI INT4 fast decode and chunked-prefill FIA paths
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add _forward_kivi_decode_fast: DecodeOnly→FIA_TND with vectorized
  dequantization (_gather_dequant_kivi_paged_cache_vectorized)
- Add _forward_kivi_prefill_fia: PrefillNoCache→FIA_TND direct path
- Add _forward_kivi_chunked_prefill: split decode/prefill FIA path
- Add _overlay_kivi_residual_tensors for residual cache injection
- Change default kivi_group_size and kivi_residual_length from 32 to 128
- Add KIVI diagnostic counters and step logging (every 10 steps)
- Fix AscendYaRNRotaryEmbedding.__init__ to initialize use_mtp and
  force_native_qwen2_rope fields required by AscendRotaryEmbedding.forward_oot()

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
